Process PDK     : SkyWater 130nm High-Density (Sky130A)
Nominal Clock   : 75.0 MHz Core (T_clk = 13.33 ns) | 12.5 MHz Controller (T_ctrl = 80.0 ns)
Timing Analysis : OpenSTA 3.1.0 using Sky130 discrete corner Liberty libraries + SPICE-calibrated delay tracking
Status          : Engineering Characterization & Design-Flow Prototype (PDK Library Verified: TT, FF, SS)
========================================================================================================

